&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality &amp;amp; Advocacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver high-quality, patient-centered care across a diverse range of clinical needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with a multidisciplinary team to ensure seamless continuity of care.&lt;/li&gt;
