&lt;h2&gt;About &lt;a href=&quot;https://asktia.com/company/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Tia&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Tia is building a new model for women’s healthcare, one that treats women as whole people rather than as separate conditions or life stages. By integrating primary care, mental health, gynecology, dermatology, and wellness across in-person and virtual settings, Tia is improving outcomes and creating a better experience for patients and providers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Family Medicine or Internal Medicine physician to provide comprehensive primary care at Tia’s &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://asktia.com/locations/tia-soho/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;SoHo&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; clinic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Our primary need is for an experienced outpatient physician who is confident managing preventive care, acute concerns, and chronic conditions. Prior women’s health or gynecology experience is helpful, but it is not required. We welcome strong primary care physicians who are interested in expanding their knowledge of women’s health within a collaborative and supportive clinical environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;As a Physician at Tia, you will care for women across different life stages using a whole-person approach. You will manage a broad range of primary care needs while partnering with colleagues across gynecology, mental health, wellness, and clinical operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;This role also offers opportunities to teach, support clinical decision-making across the care team, and provide feedback to Tia’s technology teams as they develop tools that support patient care.&lt;/p&gt;
